      "seq": 14,
      "text": "• Events\n• Qualification\n• Team USA Checklist\n• Kit Information\n\nTo see sponsored ads, please enable JavaScript.\n\nAge Group Team USA is a program for top U.S. amateur triathletes to represent their nation at the World Triathlon Age Group Championships. Since 1989, it has connected athletes to over 35 years of national pride, global competition, and community. Selection is performance-based, offering a chance to compete internationally alongside a passionate network of triathletes.\nThere are five ways to qualify for Team USA. View qualification criteria here.",
