      "seq": 20,
      "text": "All 2026 Team USA Town Halls will be at 4 p.m. MST\nRegister for 2026 Town Halls here!\nFeb. 4 - Recorded Town Hall\nMarch 4 - Recorded Town Hall (PW: 0xJ$%e?h)\nApril 1 - Recorded Town Hall (PW: jx8G@8$q)\nMay 6 - Recorded Town Hall\nJune 3 - Recorded Town Hall\nJuly 1 - Recorded Town Hall\nAug. 12\nSept. 2\nOct. 7\nNov. 4\nDec. 2\n\nWatch past Team USA Town Halls",
