      "queue": "Team USA",
      "category": "Team USA › Expenses",
      "seq": 21,
      "text": "Team USA is funded through the deposits paid by athletes on the team with some USA Triathlon partners creating cost offsets in other areas of need. An athlete's typical costs can be broken down into several categories:\n\n• $110 Spot Fee: Confirms your roster spot (non-refundable)\n• $160 - $400 Event Entry Fee: to be paid when World Triathlon announces the fee\n• $200-$400 Race Uniform: mandatory Team USA ordered through Zoot. Can be customized with athlete name\n• $110 Team Kit: shorts and top worn at Parade of Nations event, throughout race week\n• $500 - $1,500 International Travel: flights can be arranged through USA Triathlon travel partner or independently\n• $200 - $320/day Lodging/Food/Bike Shipping/Rentals/Other: travel packages offered through USA Triathlon travel partner or independently",
      "char_len": 803,
      "excluded": 0,
      "embed_model": null,
      "fetched_at_mtn": "2026-08-06 07:51:11",
      "fetched_at_utc": "2026-08-06 13:51:11",
      "created_at_mtn": "2026-08-06 07:51:11",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-08-06 13:51:11"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "https://www.usatriathlon.org/our-community/age-group-team-usa#22",
