      "scope": "queue",
      "queue": "Team USA",
      "category": "Team USA › Anti-Doping Policy",
      "seq": 22,
      "text": "All members of Team USA are expected to abide by USADA policies, protocols and rules. In-depth information and resources can be found on USA Triathlon's anti-doping page .",
